<title>JAPAN: TABLE - Japan Jan-June trade surplus up 28.4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Japan Jan-June trade surplus up 28.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's customs-cleared trade surplus in the first half of calendar 1997 rose 28.4 percent from a year earlier to 3.98 trillion yen, Finance Ministry said on Thursday. </p>
<p>(Unadjusted data, in million yen)</p>
<p>				     JAN-JUNE	    PCT CHG</p>
<p>  Overall balance	     3,981,936	    +28.4</p>
<p>    Exports		    24,729,396	    +15.1</p>
<p>    Imports		    20,747,460	    +12.9</p>
<p> (Country breakdown)	   JAN-JUNE	    PCT CHG</p>
<p>  With U.S.		     2,233,974	    +48.8</p>
<p>    Exports		     6,915,595	    +18.9</p>
<p>    Imports		     4,681,621	     +8.5</p>
<p>  With EU			 1,048,839	    +43.9</p>
<p>    Exports		     3,836,048	    +13.4</p>
<p>    Imports		     2,787,209	     +5.1</p>
<p>  With Asia		     2,917,827	     +9.4</p>
